rom/
build/
work/
**/tools/gbemu-cli/
**/tools/mesen/
**/tools/mesen-s/
**/tools/gpgx/
**/tools/dosbox-pure/
**/tools/applewin/
**/tools/puae/
**/tools/vice/
**/tools/beetle-psx/
**/tools/nugget/
**/tools/virtualjaguar/
__pycache__/
*.bps
*.ips
# Exception (owner's decision 2026-11-12): test saves made by a game's own tools, and (2026-11-15) saves the
# capture agents made while playing; both in games/<platform>/<slug>/saves/, documented in its README.md. Downloaded saves
# stay in rom/saves/ (ignored).
!games/*/*/saves/*.sav
!games/*/*/saves/*.state
# enlarged copies of database shots are made on demand (tools/x3.py), never committed
games/*/*/shots/*/[0-9]x/
!games/gbc/wizardry-empire/shots/*/3x/
